        <mxCell id="hld-flink" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px;'&gt;Confluent Cloud Flink SQL Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;1-Minute Tumbling Windows&lt;/b&gt; on &lt;code&gt;event_time&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 5-Second Watermark Delay Tolerance&lt;br&gt;• Dual Stream Group Aggregation&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Stream-to-Stream Full Outer Discrepancy Join&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Filters &lt;code&gt;device_total != system_total&lt;/code&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#CE93D8;strokeColor=#4A148C;fontSize=11;spacing=8;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
